expect \[sa\] anvil sagld 1 minecraft:iron_sword .* -> 1 minecraft:iron_sword
> pbot remove sagld
look the three golden pairs give empty; the sword + Sharpness control gives a sword (probe works). The enchreg and /enchant halves PASSED in r1103
